 "description": "They follow the light. So you stay dark.\n\nKit vs The End is an original, serialized zombie survival story told one day at a time. You live through a zombie outbreak as Kit, a stick figure trying to survive with a small group of survivors and one very loyal dog.\n\nSeason 1: At Sea (Day 0 to 100) is complete. Watch it as a full movie or episode by episode.\nSeason 2: Landfall starts on Day 101.\n\nWhat makes it different:\n✅ One continuous story with the same characters and places from start to finish.\n✅ Every survival trick is real and researched, with sources listed under each episode (IMO, NOAA, US Coast Guard, US Army survival manuals, EPA).\n✍️ Every episode is written, researched and edited by me. Images and voices are made with AI tools.\n\nSubscribe and stay dark. 🔦\n\nThe story is fiction, not safety advice.\n\n",
